    "text": {
     "en": "Take a rectangular sheet and fold it in half. There are many ways: fold along the middle length-wise or width-wise.\nTake a square sheet. Fold it in half from side to side or corner to corner. All these give equal halves.\nShow half of a whole by colouring one of two equal parts.\nDraw a line to show one-half. Draw the other half to complete a picture.\nThe same whole can be divided into halves in many different ways, but the parts must be equal.\nFold twice to get quarters."
    }
